# 💡 Interview Tips

✅ If repeatedly selecting largest element → Max Heap.

✅ If repeatedly selecting smallest element → Min Heap.

✅ Sort before applying greedy whenever deadlines exist.

✅ Greedy + Heap is one of the most important interview patterns.

✅ Learn Course Schedule III and IPO thoroughly.

---

# ⚠️ Common Mistakes

❌ Using sorting only when dynamic selection is required.

❌ Forgetting to remove longest course in Course Schedule III.

❌ Using min heap instead of max heap.

❌ Ignoring affordable-project condition in IPO.

❌ Missing leading zero removal in Remove K Digits.

